    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20645" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούπαις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αιδος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>big boy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1206
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				402
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.760
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				47.85
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Philippi</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				2.14
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>child of the ox</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουγενής</span>
			, of bees, in allusion to their fabulous origin, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.36
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Eryc.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a
			<i>fish</i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχυρός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουκόλος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
